# LF in the repository and in every checkout. With core.autocrlf on, as it
# is on the maintainer's Windows machine, git would otherwise check files
# out with CRLF while build.py writes LF, and byte-for-byte comparisons of
# two builds or of a staged tree would fail on line endings alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
